==Old English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ang|fealo|falu}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*falwaz}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*pel-}}.

Cognate with {{cog|osx|falu}}, {{cog|dum|valu}}, {{m|dum|vale}} ({{cog|nl|vaal}}), {{cog|goh|falo}} ({{cog|de|fahl}}), {{cog|non|fǫlr}}. The common Germanic is cognate with {{cog|la|pallidus}}, {{cog|grc|πελιτνός}} and {{cog|xcl|ալիք||wave, gray hair}}.

